   "top": 400,
   "left": -500,
   "attrs": {
    "text": "Simulation notes:\n- Wokwi has no L298N or DC motor. The orange\n  MOTOR LED gets the D5 PWM through the relay\n  contact, so its brightness = motor speed.\n- Real build: the 5 V rail comes from the SMPS and\n  the relay switches the SMPS 12 V to the L298N."
   }
